{"id":"6bfeb4f8252f7054fcf1fbc11ec9b3846defc749","axis":"silent","repo":"caddyserver/caddy","sha":"6bfeb4f8252f7054fcf1fbc11ec9b3846defc749","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"modules/caddyhttp/caddyauth/basicauth.go","lines":["@@ -280,6 +280,25 @@ type Hasher interface {"," \tFakeHash() []byte"," }"," ","+// hashesNamespace is the module namespace of password hashing modules.","+const hashesNamespace = \"http.authentication.hashes\"","+","+// hashModuleInfo returns the module info of the installed password","+// hashing module with the given name (e.g. \"bcrypt\"). If no such module","+// is installed, the returned error lists the available algorithms.","+func hashModuleInfo(name string) (caddy.ModuleInfo, error) {","+\tmods := caddy.GetModules(hashesNamespace)","+\tnames := make([]string, 0, len(mods))","+\tfor _, mod := range mods {","+\t\tif mod.ID.Name() == name {","+\t\t\treturn mod, nil","+\t\t}","+\t\tnames = append(names, mod.ID.Name())","+\t}","+\treturn caddy.ModuleInfo{}, fmt.Errorf(\"unrecognized hash algorithm: %s (available: %s)\",","+\t\tname, strings.Join(names, \", \"))","+}","+"," // Account contains a username and password."," type Account struct {"," \t// A user's username."],"additions":19,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"modules/caddyhttp/caddyauth/caddyfile.go","lines":["@@ -33,6 +33,8 @@ func init() {"," //\t    ..."," //\t}"," //","+// The hash algorithm is the name of any installed module in the","+// http.authentication.hashes namespace, such as bcrypt or argon2id."," // If no hash algorithm is supplied, bcrypt will be assumed."," func parseCaddyfile(h httpcaddyfile.Helper) (caddyhttp.MiddlewareHandler, error) {"," \th.Next() // consume directive name","@@ -45,7 +47,6 @@ func parseCaddyfile(h httpcaddyfile.Helper) (caddyhttp.MiddlewareHandler, error)"," \tvar ba HTTPBasicAuth"," \tba.HashCache = new(Cache)"," ","-\tvar cmp Comparer"," \targs := h.RemainingArgs()"," "," \tvar hashName string","@@ -61,13 +62,13 @@ func parseCaddyfile(h ht